WEBVTT

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:05.670
Open Settings.

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:07.848
Archive & delete holds both jobs.

00:00:07.848 --> 00:00:10.396
Tick the folders to clear.

00:00:10.396 --> 00:00:14.282
Choose the years.

00:00:14.282 --> 00:00:17.006
Choose when and how to delete.

00:00:17.006 --> 00:00:18.564
The summary shows what will be removed.

00:00:18.564 --> 00:00:20.736
Tick the confirmation and Start.

00:00:20.736 --> 00:00:22.586
The job starts and runs in the background.

00:00:22.586 --> 00:00:29.586
The progress panel follows the job. The wait is shortened here.

00:00:29.586 --> 00:00:33.800
The job finishes.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:38.501
The Vault view still holds the archived emails.

00:00:38.501 --> 00:00:40.000
The Server view no longer lists them.
